              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tracy Altemose"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Trying to Duplicate a Local Restaurants Maple Poppyseed Dressing. It is a Staple for them. Popular served with Chicken Fingers and Sweet Potato Fries!!! Try it! You'll never eat them again without Maple Poppyseed Dip/Dressing! \nI did Double the Maple Syrup and also Doubled the Red Wine Vinegar. Also added 2 teaspoons of Dijon Mustard!! Added more Maple taste and a bit of a tang to the back of your pallet. Awesome!!",
            "datePublished": "2017-12-07T17:58:35.853Z"
          },
          {
