              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kristine Ramsey-Suhm"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I really love this dressing. I use it on a mixed green salad with mandarin oranges, sliced strawberries, and red onions. I recently made this for a PTA luncheon with grilled chicken and it was a huge hit. I always make it with the \"olive oil mayo\" and \"real\" maple syrup, I was asked for the recipe at least 20 times.",
            "datePublished": "2009-11-04T18:51:01.100Z"
          },
          {
