            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MelissasMeals"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm sorry, this just tasted like PURE mayo to me! I was so excited and even added the red food coloring to make it pink. When I tasted it- I gagged! I just kept adding more maple syrup, sugar,and vinegar but I couldn't cover up the mayo taste!! I made my husband taste it before I brought it to a party and he said to leave it home!! Sorry- not for us.",
            "datePublished": "2009-07-20T05:10:28.453Z"
          },
